{"words": [{"text": "وَلَتَجِدَنَّهُمْ", "translation": "And surely you will find them"}, {"text": "أَحْرَصَ", "translation": "(the) most greedy"}, {"text": "ٱلنَّاسِ", "translation": "(of) [the] mankind"}, {"text": "عَلَىٰ", "translation": "for"}, {"text": "حَيَوٰةٍۢ", "translation": "life"}, {"text": "وَمِنَ", "translation": "and (greedier) than"}, {"text": "ٱلَّذِينَ", "translation": "those who"}, {"text": "أَشْرَكُوا۟ ۚ", "translation": "associate[d] partners (with Allah)"}, {"text": "يَوَدُّ", "translation": "Loves"}, {"text": "أَحَدُهُمْ", "translation": "(each) one of them"}, {"text": "لَوْ", "translation": "if"}, {"text": "يُعَمَّرُ", "translation": "he could be granted a life"}, {"text": "أَلْفَ", "translation": "(of) a thousand"}, {"text": "سَنَةٍۢ", "translation": "year(s)"}, {"text": "وَمَا", "translation": "But not"}, {"text": "هُوَ", "translation": "it"}, {"text": "بِمُزَحْزِحِهِۦ", "translation": "(will) remove him"}, {"text": "مِنَ", "translation": "from"}, {"text": "ٱلْعَذَابِ", "translation": "the punishment"}, {"text": "أَن", "translation": "that"}, {"text": "يُعَمَّرَ ۗ", "translation": "he should be granted life"}, {"text": "وَٱللَّهُ", "translation": "And Allah"}, {"text": "بَصِيرٌۢ", "translation": "(is) All-Seer"}, {"text": "بِمَا", "translation": "of what"}, {"text": "يَعْمَلُونَ", "translation": "they do"}], "sahih": "And you will surely find them the most greedy of people for life - [even] more than those who associate others with Allāh. One of them wishes that he could be granted life a thousand years, but it would not remove him in the least from the [coming] punishment that he should be granted life. And Allāh is Seeing of what they do."}